acot_note/1003_iteration_workflow.md:15:| P3 | **冷启动锁错主导长尾** | 初始锁对:PGIF 正确比例 0.96/0.90/0.80;初始锁错:0.017/0.094/0.008(Town05 / Town10HD / reid),锁错开局占 7/19、11/20、7/19 | PGIF 会坚持错误的初始身份 |
acot_note/1003_iteration_workflow.md:17:| P5 | **重捕获率在部分设定下降** | Town10HD 0.31→0.17,reid 0.55→0.15(附录 B) | 回火让重新入画的正确身份需要时间积累证据 |
acot_note/1003_iteration_workflow.md:18:| P6 | **泛化证据弱** | 单设定 Town10HD/reid 不显著,合并 n=58 才显著;Town10HD 在训练数据中出现过 | 缺真正没见过的场景 |
acot_note/1003_iteration_workflow.md:26:- **C2(方法,升级)**:PGIF 从"包 TAHRelM"推广为**异构记忆融合层**——每个记忆(TAHRelM、DAM4SAM、语言 grounding)给出"选择 + 置信度",按各自的置信度秩加权、按误差相关时间回火,融合成一个 tracklet 级后验;后验再门控**每个**记忆的更新/重置。
acot_note/1003_iteration_workflow.md:27:- **C3(方法,新增)**:**延迟承诺的冷启动**——开局先在 tracklet 上积累语言(+ 记忆)证据,证据充分才承诺,攻 P3。
acot_note/1003_iteration_workflow.md:34:| 版本 | 内容 | 攻哪个问题 | 预注册假设(Town05,n=19 配对) | 主要改动 |
acot_note/1003_iteration_workflow.md:40:| **V4**(时间允许) | **重捕获感知回火**:目标 tracklet 重新入画后短窗口内提高新证据权重 | P5 | 重捕获率不低于无纠偏,正确比例不下降 | `asd.py` |
acot_note/1003_iteration_workflow.md:51:(c) 闭环主实验:Town05,seeds 91000–19,deployable,3 台 CARLA 并行(约 80–90 min/臂)
acot_note/1003_iteration_workflow.md:53:(e) 泛化实验(仅通过 G_k 的版本):Town10HD + Town03(训练集外地图)各 20 ep,与 DAM4SAM、V0 配对
acot_note/1003_iteration_workflow.md:66:| 0:00–0:45 | 预检:Town03 加入场景配置并冒烟;DAM4SAM 服务返回置信度;V1/V2 设计文档 + R1^a、R2^a | Town03 冒烟(2 ep) | DAM4SAM · Town10HD(泛化对照所需) | TAHRelM 无纠偏 · Town03 |
acot_note/1003_iteration_workflow.md:67:| 0:45–2:15 | 实现 V1、V2;R3^a(V3 设计) | **V1** · Town05 | **V2** · Town05 | DAM4SAM · Town03 |
acot_note/1003_iteration_workflow.md:68:| 2:15–3:45 | G1/G2 判定;实现 V3 | V1 · Town10HD(若过 G1) | V2 · Town10HD(若过 G2) | PGIF(V0)· Town03 |
acot_note/1003_iteration_workflow.md:69:| 3:45–5:15 | R1^b、R2^b | **V3** · Town05 | V1 · Town03 | V2 · Town03 |
acot_note/1003_iteration_workflow.md:70:| 5:15–6:45 | G3 判定;V4 设计 + R4^a(可选) | V3 · Town10HD | V3 · Town03 | 最优版本扩种子 91020–39 |
acot_note/1003_iteration_workflow.md:72:| 8:15–9:45 | V4(若做) | V4 · Town05 | 补跑 / 失败重跑 | 补跑 |
acot_note/1003_iteration_workflow.md:79:1. **只用 deployable**:身份决策不使用真值(候选框与车辆定位为仿真理想输入,写作中声明)。gt-seeded 不进入任何对比。
acot_note/1003_iteration_workflow.md:81:3. **同种子配对**:主实验 seeds 91000–19;扩种子 91020–39;配对 bootstrap 95% CI;冷启动分层用 `rollout/tick_align.py` 对齐。
acot_note/1003_iteration_workflow.md:90:| Town03 场景生成失败(场景配置/遮挡缓存) | 预检时 2 ep 冒烟;失败则泛化只用 Town10HD + 跨记忆,并在 roadmap 中说明 |
acot_note/1003_iteration_workflow.md:92:| V3 两个记忆同时运行显存/时间翻倍 | DAM4SAM 服务单独占 GPU 6;必要时 V3 只跑 Town05 + Town03 |
acot_note/1003_iteration_workflow.md:98:- **性能**:存在一个版本在 Town05 上正确锁定比例 **不低于** DAM4SAM(非劣)且最长锁错 **显著低于** DAM4SAM;最好同时在 Town03(训练集外)上方向一致。
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:7:  seed: null                       # set per-episode by generate_batch (seed + episode_id)
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:12:  loss_events:                     # (c) deliberate SUSTAINED target-loss for predict-intercept.
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:18:  towns: ["Town01", "Town02", "Town04", "Town05", "Town10HD"]  # Town06 not in this image
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:24:# Multi-actor scene composition (design §5.1/§6.3): >=2 look-alike distractors,
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:25:# co-located with the target so language must carry the discriminating attribute.
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:27:  num_distractors: [4, 8]
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:28:  min_similar_distractors: 3        # >=3 look-alikes so >=2 stay co-visible
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:29:  distractor_ahead_bias: 0.75       # (legacy layout only; ignored when decorrelate_position on)
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:35:                                    #     distractors between UAV & target → decorrelates depth RANK (`nearest`).
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:36:    aim_offset_frac: 0.25           # §9: smooth camera-aim offset as a fraction of viewing distance →
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:37:                                    #     target's IMAGE position spreads like a distractor's (not locked
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:41:                                    #     10 keeps co-visibility ~64% (6 collided too much → 40%).
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:46:                                    #     target is a random cluster member → position/depth/rank == a distractor's.
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:51:    radius: 70                      # tighter → more of them land in the camera view
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:56:  covisibility:                     # smooth off-screen recycle keeps >=2 look-alikes co-visible (spec §4d)
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:58:    recycle_radius: 55.0            # recycle a similar look-alike once it drifts this far off-camera
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:61:    car: 0.65                       # background distractors (ambient), never targets
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:69:    distinct: 0.20                 # easy tail (distractors visually distinct)
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:75:  suitable: {weight: 0.33, altitude: [22, 28]}   # a 4 m car projects to ~36-49 px at 512/FOV70
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:76:  long:     {weight: 0.33, altitude: [28, 34]}   # (was ~12 px @ 336/FOV90/54 m → make unreadable)
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:79:# use a shallower, lower-altitude oblique view to surface urban side-wall occlusion.
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:80:camera:
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:81:  pitch_deg: -50.0
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:83:    fraction: 0.0                  # scenarios override (occlusion_heavy → 0.30)
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:84:    pitch_deg: -38.0
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:86:    behind_range: [22, 30]         # MUST match pitch: depression=atan(alt/behind)≈38° so
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:94:  fog_density: [0, 0]      # no fog — clear visibility
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:98:  # Start geometry corrected so the target lands in-frame: camera pitch is -30°
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:99:  # (drone.get_camera_transform) with 90° FOV → keep depression atan(alt/dist)
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:158:occlusion:
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:159:  heavy_occlusion_target: true
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:160:  min_occlusion_ratio: 0.3        # episode must have ≥30% partial occlusion
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:162:    num_rays: 8                   # from target bbox corners to UAV
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:164:  # A1c③ in-frame structural-occlusion routing. Off by default; occlusion scenarios
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:167:  bias_fraction: 0.0              # scenarios override (occlusion_heavy → 0.6)
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:178:  rgb_resolution: [512, 512]      # §10: 336→512 so small aerial targets get enough pixels
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:179:  fov: 90.0                       # 2026-10-03: 70→90 to match what Stage-2 v5 was actually trained on (the original v5
carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml:180:                                  # recorder hard-coded 90°) and the closed-loop camera (env.py fov_deg=90). The 09-04 regen
